<title>UK: Rabobank sets 500 mln guilder 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 500 mln guilder 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rabobank Nederland said on Wednesday it was lead manager of the following Eurobond for itself.</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    15.APR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.93    PAY DATE    15.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.33     SPREAD	+17.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-100-1M  SALE LIMITS US/GB/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.40	SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED CURVE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
